  "claims": [
    {
      "text": "He slowly flaps a pair of bone wings. Bone armor covers his body, and colorful sharp spikes grow from his elbows, knees, shoulders, and other places. At first look he is a malevolent multi-colored human-shaped hedgehog.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt"
    },
    {
      "text": "His soft bones Gu turns bones soft until they become a puddle of bone paste. Fang Yuan judges that demonic Gu Masters mostly rely on luck or fate, and that Ku Mo and Wu Gui hold one or two rank five Gu, unlike Tie Mu Bai with Tie clan behind him.",
      "chapters": [
        373
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "appearance",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "gu_soft_bones_gu",
        "char_fang_yuan",
        "sys_demonic_path",
        "char_wu_gui",
        "char_tie_mu_bai",
        "fac_tie_clan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "A month later, Wang Xiao arrives. Two months later, Wu Lan Shan arrives, fights Wang Xiao to a draw, and her showing is said to exceed Ku Mo and Wu Gui.",
      "chapters": [
        375
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "strength-comparison",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_wang_xiao",
        "char_wu_lan_shan"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Tie Mu Bai takes the lead entering King Xin Inheritance. After he chooses it, Wu Gui and Ku Mo look at each other and decide to avoid encountering him there.",
      "chapters": [
        376
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "inheritance-choice",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_king_xin_inheritance"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Inside King Quan Inheritance he commands several hundred steel armor dogs and has already recruited a jade eye dog king with dog enslavement Gu. Space tears open, Fang Yuan appears, and golden dragon Gu almost smashes his entire upper body. He dies without using his token.",
      "chapters": [
        380
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "inh_king_quan_inheritance",
        "gu_dog_enslavement_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "He held eight Gu worms: one rank five soft bones Gu, and seven rank four Gu tied to the bone path. Fang Yuan keeps the set rather than fight with it, then feeds the aperture to beast strength placenta Gu. Narration calls him a great expert born as a lone cultivator who slogged alone his whole life, with many encounters and hard work, until that work became Fang Yuan’s loot.",
      "chapters": [
        380
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "death",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "sys_gu_worms",
        "gu_beast_strength_placenta_gu"
      ]
    },
    {
      "text": "Fang Yuan tells Bai Ning Bing that he killed Tie Mu Bai, Wu Gui, and Ku Mo, and shows the taken Gu as proof. He later counts five rank five Gu Masters on San Cha mountain and places only Tie Mu Bai, Ku Mo, and Wu Gui at rank five peak stage, above Wu Lan Shan and Wang Xiao at upper stage and Chou Jiu at initial stage.",
      "chapters": [
        381
      ],
      "certainty": "canon",
      "confidence": "B",
      "verification": "cross_checked_chapter_summary",
      "source_id": "src_sagaofgu",
      "section": "lineup-among-five",
      "text_origin": "source_excerpt",
      "mentions": [
        "char_bai_ning_bing",
        "fac_gu_masters",
        "loc_san_cha_mountain",
        "char_chou_jiu"
      ]
    }
  ],
